## 1. Executive Summary

`zenray-meshes` stops at raw VEX `Build*.py` SOP/HDA geometry and an unlinked UI `/edit` preview, while `zenray-houdini` already provides a hardened, self-tested downstream stack covering geometric quality assurance, straight artist-cut UV unwrapping (`0.999` threshold), reference delighting without an image model call, per-island 2D height alignment (`0.99944`), and Copernicus 5-map PBR generation (`BaseColor`, `Normal`, `Height`, `Roughness`, `AO`, `Metallic`, `ORM`).

Connecting the two eliminates three major sources of manual rework:
1. **Lit-reference bias in CMY extraction:** Directional studio lighting in `master.png` creates asymmetric highlight/shadow gradients across symmetric edges, corrupting `BuildYellowEdge.py` and `BuildRimSym.py` ridge weights. Running [`DelightBaseColor.py`](/Users/zenray/.claude/skills/zenray-houdini/scripts/height/DelightBaseColor.py) + [`CheckAiHeight.py`](/Users/zenray/.claude/skills/zenray-houdini/scripts/height/CheckAiHeight.py) neutralizes light gradients analytically before edge extraction and extracts an unlit `BaseColor` directly.
2. **Broken meshes reaching UV/Unreal:** Passing raw VEX extrusion shells without [`GeoAudit.py`](/Users/zenray/.claude/skills/zenray-houdini/scripts/geo/GeoAudit.py), [`ContactGraph.py`](/Users/zenray/.claude/skills/zenray-houdini/scripts/geo/ContactGraph.py), and [`HiddenFaces.py`](/Users/zenray/.claude/skills/zenray-houdini/scripts/geo/HiddenFaces.py) leaks open seams, flipped winding, floating hardware, and buried faces wasting UV texel budget.
3. **Manual UV seams and arbitrary texel density:** Writing intrinsic `(gu, gv)` quad coordinates plus CMY Yellow crease groups (`zrm_seam_suggest` / `zrm_keep_edge`) on the component geometry lets [`HeadlessM1.py`](/Users/zenray/.claude/skills/zenray-houdini/scripts/zenray_uv/HeadlessM1.py) compute square `1:1` UVs (`1024 px/m` prop, `2048 px/m` character, hard cap `4096 px`, `8192 px` banned) and hand off cleanly to [`HeightInputs.py`](/Users/zenray/.claude/skills/zenray-houdini/scripts/zenray_uv/HeightInputs.py), [`PerIslandAlign.py`](/Users/zenray/.claude/skills/zenray-houdini/scripts/height/PerIslandAlign.py), [`HeightToBaseColor.py`](/Users/zenray/.claude/skills/zenray-houdini/scripts/height/HeightToBaseColor.py), and [`HeightTo5MapsCop.py`](/Users/zenray/.claude/skills/zenray-houdini/scripts/height/HeightTo5MapsCop.py).

