## 5. Exact Pitfall Guards When Connecting the Two Skills

1. **Resolution Ceiling Rule (`zenray-uv`):** Never emit `8192` sheets. Default `2048 px` per tile (`4096 px` hard ceiling only for multi-piece heroes).
2. **Staircase UV Ban (`zenray-uv`):** Rectangular border strips (`Arm_Cuff` trim bands, bevel walls, cylinder bark barrels) MUST be aligned orthogonally along `U`/`V` axes (`straighten` pass) so pixel-aligned relief maps from Copernicus do not alias on diagonal edges.
3. **Foreground Mask Padding Before Delighting:** Applying global `gaussian_filter` on `master.png` without padding background pixels smears background brightness (`105`) into object rims. Pad outside `mask.png` via nearest-foreground extension before calling `DelightBaseColor.relight`.
4. **Houdini Winding Sign Convention:** Houdini inward normals produce `volume < 0` in `GeoAudit.py` and invert extruded thickness. Always run `GeoAudit.audit` immediately after mesh build and reverse winding automatically if `flipped_pieces > 0`.
